* course reflection

I liked how the course was structured around building the same project throughout the semester. 
Continuously working on and improving one project made it feel more meaningful and gave a stronger sense of achievement by the end.
The skills we learned felt practical and applicable, especially in terms of building an actual app, conducting user testing, and making improvements based on feedback.
Working on three interconnected projects was also useful. It required thinking about the role and purpose of each app and how they work together as a system.



